# The committed, pre-built CLI bundle the GitHub Action imports is a generated artifact.
# Force LF so the `git diff --exit-code` freshness gate in smoke CI is deterministic across
# platforms (esbuild always emits LF; without this, a Windows checkout's autocrlf could show false
# drift against a Linux CI regeneration). Treat it as binary-ish: no eol translation, no merge.
manifest-sync/vendor/manifest-cli.mjs -text
manifest-sync/vendor/manifest.schema.json text eol=lf
